{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Airflow",
    "steam_appid": 1693800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take ownership of an airspace, learn its unique features, and coordinate with others to design your own procedures and arrival streams. Feel the rush of managing high-pressure situations at busy airspaces and the satisfaction of delivering aircraft on time without conflicts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn real-world airspaces, procedures, and phraseology. Start at smaller airports, earn endorsements, and climb the ranks to the world\u2019s busiest airspaces. Mimic real airport operations or develop your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with neighboring controllers or split airspaces to tackle challenges too big for one person. Communicate effectively to maintain safe separation and efficient traffic flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the different position types to find which  suits you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ramp/Ground - Sequence aircraft along taxiways in a puzzle-like role. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower - Take responsibility for runway operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approach - Funnel aircraft to their destination in a 3D spatial-awareness challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enroute/Oceanic - Plan routes, schedules, and create highways of long-haul traffic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Autonomous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control with confidence knowing that pilots will follow your commands precisely. No need for behind-the-scenes instructors or virtual pilots. Since pilots fly entirely on their own, even the busiest airspaces can reach peak traffic levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Efficient</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay organized with helpful tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight Strip Bay -\u00a0Sort your flights and quickly lookup routes or vector assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight Board - Gauge traffic levels and check flight status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination Page - Coordinate with neighboring controllers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your radar scope to fit your needs, displaying relevant airports, navaids, runway centerlines, procedures, etc. Start with labels and then gradually declutter as you naturally memorize the airspace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take ownership of an airspace, learn its unique features, and coordinate with others to design your own procedures and arrival streams. Feel the rush of managing high-pressure situations at busy airspaces and the satisfaction of delivering aircraft on time without conflicts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn real-world airspaces, procedures, and phraseology. Start at smaller airports, earn endorsements, and climb the ranks to the world\u2019s busiest airspaces. Mimic real airport operations or develop your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with neighboring controllers or split airspaces to tackle challenges too big for one person. Communicate effectively to maintain safe separation and efficient traffic flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the different position types to find which  suits you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ramp/Ground - Sequence aircraft along taxiways in a puzzle-like role. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tower - Take responsibility for runway operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approach - Funnel aircraft to their destination in a 3D spatial-awareness challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enroute/Oceanic - Plan routes, schedules, and create highways of long-haul traffic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Autonomous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control with confidence knowing that pilots will follow your commands precisely. No need for behind-the-scenes instructors or virtual pilots. Since pilots fly entirely on their own, even the busiest airspaces can reach peak traffic levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Efficient</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay organized with helpful tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight Strip Bay -\u00a0Sort your flights and quickly lookup routes or vector assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight Board - Gauge traffic levels and check flight status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination Page - Coordinate with neighboring controllers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your radar scope to fit your needs, displaying relevant airports, navaids, runway centerlines, procedures, etc. Start with labels and then gradually declutter as you naturally memorize the airspace.</p>",
    "short_description": "Test your spatial awareness and coordination skills to reach peak aircraft flow rates at the world\u2019s busiest airspaces in this air traffic control (ATC) simulator.",
